brush-coreutils-builtins) — a POSIX/bash shell runtime in Rust — used by the
`agent-bridle-tool-shell` crate with the `brush` feature. The
`carried-coreutils` feature adds the focused bundled utility set used as the
carried, batteries-included shell/coreutils runtime ("the hands").

